"A girl looking at big hibiscus flower","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"A girl giving hibiscus to mother in kitchen","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"A girl and mother laughing over red hibiscus","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"Red hibiscus flower","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/433011-manu-yenu-thandiruve/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಮನು, ಬೇಗ ಬಾ, ಕರಿಬೇವಿನ ಸೊಪ್ಪು ತಾ.”"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/433011-manu-yenu-thandiruve/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಭೋಲು, ನೀನೂ ನಡಿ ಜೊತೆಗೆ!”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/433011-manu-yenu-thandiruve/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಏನು ಕಾಣಿಸಿತು ನಿನಗೆ?”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/433011-manu-yenu-thandiruve/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಏಯ್ ಚಿಟ್ಟೆ ಇರು, ಇರು.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/433011-manu-yenu-thandiruve/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಎಷ್ಟು ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿದೆ! ಅಮ್ಮನಿಗೆ ಇಷ್ಟವಾಗತ್ತೆ.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/433011-manu-yenu-thandiruve/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಮ್ಮಾ ನೋಡಿಲ್ಲಿ,","ಏನು ತಂದಿದ್ದೇನೆ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/433011-manu-yenu-thandiruve/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅರೆ ಮನು, ಕರಿಬೇವಿನ ಸೊಪ್ಪು ಎಲ್ಲಿ?”","“ಅಯ್ಯೋ... ಮರೆತು ಬಿಟ್ಟೆ...!!”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/433011-manu-yenu-thandiruve/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":33}